note bottom of UC36
  Layout NotebookLM:
  Sources (kiri) | Chat (tengah) | Studio (kanan).
  Toggle panel via header. Playground & Guide flows
  dipindah ke submenu Advanced.
end note

note bottom of UC10
  Mutation studioChat:
  query understanding multi-turn +
  invokeRagQuery (semantic search + grounded answer).
  Opsional sourceIds dari checkbox UC-29.
  chat_instruction dari UC-30/UC-37.
end note

note bottom of UC29
  Checkbox per sumber terindeks.
  studioChat(sourceIds: [...]) memfilter
  semantic search ke sumber terpilih.
end note

note bottom of UC30
  Modal Configure Chat menyimpan
  chat_instruction di context_config notebook.
  Mutation updateStudioNotebook.
end note

note bottom of UC31
  Mutation studioGenerateBrief:
  ringkasan otomatis setelah UC-09 allIndexed.
  Disimpan di context_config + studio_outputs.
end note

note bottom of UC32
  Query studioChunk(chunkId):
  drawer preview cuplikan penuh + skor relevansi.
end note

note bottom of UC33
  Mutation importStudioUrl:
  fetch HTML → ekstrak teks → upload + indeksasi.
end note

note bottom of UC34
  Mutation studioGenerateOutput:
  report | mind_map | quiz | faq |
  audio_script | brief | data_table.
end note

note bottom of UC35
  Query studioOutputs + deleteStudioOutput.
  Tabel studio_outputs per notebook.
end note

note bottom of UC26
  studioConversations / studioConversation:
  muat ulang pesan + source_refs dari DB.
end note

note bottom of UC13
  Expandable citations per jawaban:
  nama dokumen, cuplikan, skor relevansi %.
  Klik → UC-32 chunk preview.
end note

note bottom of UC18
  Halaman /admin/ai-studio/advanced/playground.
  Mutation studioPlaygroundTest — tanpa RAG.
end note

note bottom of UC15
  Halaman /admin/ai-studio/advanced/guide-flows.
  Kelola flow per notebook (dropdown).
end note

note bottom of PKG_IDX
  Dipicu otomatis (async) setelah UC-05/06/08/33.
  StudioIngestionService.ingestSource()
end note

@enduml
